<section id="principle" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-background border-t border-border/60">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-16">
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-5">The principle</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
          Clarity comes before tools
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-8 md:col-start-5 space-y-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          For decades, high quality strategic thinking and execution frameworks were locked inside elite consultancies, blue chip organisations, and specialist teams.
        </p>
        <p>When used properly, AI changes that.</p>
        <p>Not by replacing expertise.</p>
        <p>Not by automating decisions.</p>
        <p>
          But by making structured thinking, practical guidance, and expert level frameworks accessible beyond a privileged few.
        </p>
        <p class="pt-4">This ecosystem exists to support that shift.</p>
        <p class="pt-4 text-foreground font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight">
          AI is the enabler.
          <br />
          Judgment stays human.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
